# ---- Removed local artifacts (2026-09-29 cleanup) ----
# Transient/generated output removed from tracking; ignore so it cannot
# creep back in. `tests/test-results/` and `frontend/test-results/` are
# separate paths owned by their own .gitignore files.
#
# `.super-speckit/` is ignored per-subdirectory, NOT wholesale. Git never
# descends into an excluded directory, so a `!` negation for a child path
# cannot re-include it — the parent rule must not cover the child at all.
# Two subtrees are deliberately left TRACKED because they are the durable,
# auditable evidence of why a change was made:
#   .super-speckit/bugs/   confirmed-bug records (feature 008)
#   .super-speckit/design/ design decisions
.super-speckit/atlas/
.super-speckit/bugs/*.tmp
.super-speckit/feedback/
.super-speckit/grills/
.super-speckit/matrices/
.super-speckit/purpose/
.super-speckit/research/
.super-speckit/state/
# .super-speckit/qa/ is ignored EXCEPT the maker seed fixture, which is part
# of the 008-fix-login-wiring evidence trail and is referenced by its bug records.
.super-speckit/qa/*
!.super-speckit/qa/008-fix-login-wiring-maker2/
.super-speckit/qa/008-fix-login-wiring-maker2/*
!.super-speckit/qa/008-fix-login-wiring-maker2/seed-maker-users.ts
visual-qa-screenshots/
/test-results/

# ---- Visual QA output (keep .gitkeep placeholders) ----
tests/visual/captures/reference/
tests/visual/captures/provenance/
tests/visual/comparison/diff/
tests/visual/comparison/overlay/
tests/visual/comparison/results/
tests/visual/comparison/temp-*.png
tests/visual/noise/profiles/
!tests/visual/captures/.gitkeep
!tests/visual/comparison/diff/.gitkeep
!tests/visual/comparison/overlay/.gitkeep
!tests/visual/comparison/results/.gitkeep
!tests/visual/noise/profiles/.gitkeep

